OL,3,APregnant US inmate escapes in prison   
OL,4,Avehicle after medical appointment      
OL,6,FA pregnant inmate has escaped from     
OL,7,Fcustody in the US state of New Mexico, 
OL,8,Fafter taking control of a police       
OL,9,Fvehicle while returning to prison from 
OL,10,Fa prenatal appointment, the state's    
OL,11,Fcorrections department has said.       
OL,13,FRebecca Taylor, 26, took control of the
OL,14,FDodge Journey and drove away when the  
OL,15,Fteam transporting her and another      
OL,16,Finmate stopped to pick up food in      
OL,17,FAlbuquerque, local media reported.     
OL,19,FThe New Mexico Corrections Department  
OL,20,Fsaid that the vehicle and her prison   
OL,21,Fjumpsuit were later recovered, but     
OL,22,FTaylor remains on the run.             
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
